08","t":"","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#408","p":17,"im":["50b6032f9c3850bc8c41938806b6349258a2fadc"],"m":408},{"id":"alex_p17_409","t":"Hi Alex, I have a question and it's in the image:\n\nThanks in advance!","a":"charlespips","d":"","n":"#409","p":17,"im":["6264662c207bcacee9a49250e6601b661e0914be"],"m":409},{"id":"alex_p17_410","t":"","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#410","p":17,"im":["e27bdd32c43500cb361554e155978b90aa971b40"],"m":410},{"id":"alex_p17_411","t":"nice trading Alex","a":"to","d":"","n":"#411","p":17,"im":[],"m":411},{"id":"alex_p17_412","t":"Amazing, Beauty is in simplicity!\n\nThanks, Alex!","a":"charlespips","d":"","n":"#412","p":17,"im":[],"m":412},{"id":"alex_p17_413","t":"ENG - it`s cool","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#413","p":17,"im":["4cc45b2aed0a0c9edfff0fa0848991fa6dbf05f5","6a3d64b022ecbbd6322b1f6dccdaca71e0e19afa"],"m":413},{"id":"alex_p17_414","t":"Hi Alex, more question for you.\n\nFrom your chart's box, the FTR (in the red box) is not yet engulf, so there is no engulf of this zone yet. So what's you reason for the engulf? Is it because of the engulf of big surge up that I marked with red box?","a":"charlespips","d":"","n":"#414","p":17,"im":["745959ba4a3afecddacdbf105bd97291535ef58f"],"m":414},{"id":"alex_p17_415","t":"HI CP- if you don`t mind, I think, you need to look for obvious Swings with HH, HL and follow the market","a":"Man","d":"","n":"#415","p":17,"im":["c7a9a13a1fa80887ba8122d27968dddc9b983db7"],"m":415},{"id":"alex_p17_416","t":"Hi Man, I agree with you. СP, do u have quistions?","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#416","p":17,"im":[],"m":416},{"id":"alex_p17_417","t":"Man & Alex,\n\nOMG.... this simple? Have I think too much?\n\nThanks Man and Alex (again!) for answering my question. I really have thought too much lately and missed the simplicity.","a":"charlespips","d":"","n":"#417","p":17,"im":[],"m":417},{"id":"alex_p17_418","t":"love the \"main box\" concept. There seems to always be one in play","a":"naascott","d":"","n":"#418","p":17,"im":[],"m":418},{"id":"alex_p17_419","t":"Alex!\n\nReach my daily goal using your simple style. Thanks!","a":"charlespips","d":"","n":"#419","p":17,"im":["6f3bf63fe6a513968bbeb4bd10b4e18502e615f3"],"m":419},{"id":"alex_p17_420","t":"CP - well done","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#420","p":17,"im":[],"m":420},{"id":"alex_p17_421","t":"Dear Alex, attempting to follow your views in obvious swings, sources of important engulfs. I believe this looks like a nice setup. Would you mind confirming? Thanks for your contributions here.","a":"naascott","d":"","n":"#421","p":17,"im":["95223414b1a6357d40f03b4b61e1e3073175adf6"],"m":421},{"id":"alex_p17_422","t":"Hi Naascott, if i see this scenario, I will sell (red arrow). I want to see Eng Flag. Now i don`t see obvious Swing, mate","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#422","p":17,"im":["9a257ad9febc333505ba43236ebc3cc6ad6034d3"],"m":422},{"id":"alex_p17_423","t":"Thank you much, Alex.\n\nThat confirms that I am still not looking at some areas correctly, but it's all good. Learning from mistakes is the best kind of learning","a":"naascott","d":"","n":"#423","p":17,"im":[],"m":423},{"id":"alex_p17_424","t":"Hi Alex,\n\nToo much analysis is paralysis at the end. Our mind is blocked when too much information is processed at a time. Your way of simple and powerful style of trading is easy to understand and follow.\n\nWhen I record my trades, it takes 3~4 charts for one setup. But your trades are recorded in just one chart.\n\nHow do you start your trading day? Do you scan for engulf in higher time frame then go to lower time frame or what? Do you mark all the levels ahead or just on the particular TF?\n\nKeep posting charts.","a":"whynotnaveen","d":"","n":"#424","p":17,"im":[],"m":424},{"id":"alex_p17_425","t":"Hi Alex,\n\nI have a doubt about DP. Can you clarify it?","a":"whynotnaveen","d":"","n":"#425","p":17,"im":["a200a502c62f1e58c699c822bb7a8b9456cf36d4"],"m":425}],"images":[{"k":"cbbb82f372c254125bd64ab0c1d9a1c45add5537","t":"asse